ANACREON 10
"Algerian Fences"
0     ; random scenario
2 4   ; 2-4 players
30    ; 30 by 30 galaxy
100   ; 100 planets
2     ; Difficulty: Advanced
100 0 ; 100+ years
4021
BEGINTEXT


     The last hope for a Galactic consortium died along with the death of 
   King Frances Fillabian Farnsworth.  When the King died, the Four Princes
   of Algerius were released from their blood vows to uphold peace.  The 
   King's political marriages and bethrothals fell apart, and the Princes
   returned their home worlds, to prepare for conquest.
     The preparations are now been complete.  Each Prince is ready to spring 
   upon the worlds surrounding him, as each marchs towards the center of 
   the Galaxy.  The first steps have already been taken: each Prince has
   conquered four worlds.
      What they do with their resources is entirely up to them...

      This will be an interesting case study.

                                  Professor Rendell Laeque, Anthropology
                                  University of the Centraworlds
                                  Private Journal;  March 21, 4021

NEWPAGE
ENDTEXT                                                    
;                                                           
; Define zones for empire capitols ---------------------------------------------
;
DefineZone  2    6,5   9,8  
DefineZone  3  22,22 25,25
DefineZone  4   4,24  7,27
DefineZone  5   24,7 27,10
;
; Define locations of player capitols ------------------------------------------
;
DefineXY Cap1 Z:2 
DefineXY Cap2 Z:3
DefineXY Cap3 Z:4
DefineXY Cap4 Z:5
DefineXY NebBrk R:15,8..23
;         
; Create player empires --------------------------------------------------------
; Note: If there are less than four players, all of the worlds will be created.
;       The difference is that there will not be a full four empires.
;
CreatePlayerEmpire 0 0 9 0
CreatePlayerEmpire 1 0 9 0
CreatePlayerEmpire 2 0 9 0
CreatePlayerEmpire 3 0 9 0 
;
; Create player capitals -------------------------------------------------------
;
; Capital for empire one 
CreateWorld 1 Cap1:0,0
9       ; Earth class planet
9       ; Pre-gate level technology
4       ; Capital
0       ; Empire 1
3500    ; Population
90      ; Efficiency
;
;  LAM  def  GDM  ion
  1000 1000 5000 1500
;  fgt  hkr  jmp  jtn  pen  str  trn
  5000 2000 3500 3500  500 1000 2500
;  men nnj amb  che  met  sup  tri
  4000  0   0  3000 4500 4000 2000
;
; Capital for empire two, this is a forest planet.
CreateWorld 2 Cap2:0,0
10      ; Forest world
9       ; Pre-gate level
4       ; Capital
1       ; Empire 1
3500    ; Population    
90      ; Efficiency
;
;  LAM  def  GDM  ion
  1000 1000 5000 1500
;  fgt  hkr  jmp  jtn  pen  str  trn
  5000 2000 3500 3500  500 1000 2500
;  men nnj amb  che  met  sup  tri
  4000  0   0  3000 4500 4000 2000
;
; Capital for empire three
CreateWorld 3 Cap3:0,0
9 9 4 2 3500 90
1000 1000 5000 1500
5000 2000 3500 3500 500 1000 2500
4000 0 0 3000 4500 4000 2000
;
; Capital for empire four
CreateWorld 4 Cap4:0,0
9 9 4 3 3500 90     
1000 1000 5000 1500
5000 2000 3500 3500 500 1000 2500
4000 0 0 3000 4500 4000 2000
